              "type": "color",
              "attrs": {
               "hex": "2C3E50"
              }
             }
            ],
            "text": "USE MORPHINE WITH CAUTION - it is a preload-reducing agent & RV-MI patients are markedly sensitive to preload reduction; min or avoid if hypotensive (AHA STEMI guidelines list morphine as caution, not absolute contraindication; only nitrates carry an explicit avoidance recommendation in RV-MI)."
           }
          ]
         },
